      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each grid level to step onto and complete all goal cells. A goal only completes when the carried piece matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation at the moment you enter the goal tile; completing all goals advances to the next level, and clearing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move (N/S/E/W) costs 1 stamina; when stamina hits 0 you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Movement is constrained by walls; the state provides blocked_directions that must never be chosen. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape tiles cycle shape 0\u20135 (wrap), color tiles cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange (wrap), and rotation tiles rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise through 0/90/180/270 (wrap). A goal tile activates and can be completed only if shape, color, and rotation all match its requirements simultaneously when you step onto it; stamina refill tiles restore stamina."
      }
